wers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":9,"created_at":"2026-01-28T08:45:25Z","updated_at":"2026-02-23T19:49:51Z","closed_at":"2026-02-23T18:06:09Z","assignee":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducable in 4.6.stable.official\n\nNot reproducable in 4.5 for UI themes specifically. Although some fields show the same behavior in 4.5, for instance when wanting to edit Gradient Maps, the same type of crash can occur. Workaround in 4.5 was to right click -> edit, which bypasses the issue. This is not working anymore in 4.6.\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 Home - Godot 4.6.stable.official - Direct3D12 - dedicated NVIDIA RTX 3060ti - (driver: 591.74)\n\n### Issue description\n\nAfter assigning a Theme on any Control node, the editor crashes when I want to edit it.\n\nI encountered this behavior also on other inspector fields in the engine while I was still using 4.5, e.g. with Gradient Textures. \n\nUsually my workaround for it was to simply right click and choose edit (the pencil like icon) instead of clicking on the field directly, and it usually bypasses the crash in 4.5. In 4.6 however, this seems to no longer work.\n\nSometimes, in 4.5, it also just randomly started working again. Which also seems to not happen in 4.6 anymore. Tried it on a fresh project. Same behavior.\n\n\nCreating and saving a Theme also crashes the editor.\n\nTried creating a Theme via clicking in project window -> create resource -> Theme. Godot crashes upon trying to to save the theme. \n\nHowever, I can save out a newly assigned theme inside the field just fine. But any attempts to edit the saved theme will cause the same crash regardless.\n\nHere are two small videos demonstrating how it happens:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/181847df-9cc8-446f-930e-4cf81278a1f8\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ccb03e9a-1455-4b3c-a660-529aa7dc6c1b\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- create a fresh empty scene\n- add a Control node, any Control node\n- expand the \"Theme\" field in the inspector\n- click on \"Theme\" to add a new Theme\n- click on Theme to try to edit the Theme\n- you should experience an editor crash\n\nFor not being able to create and save Themes via the project window:\n\n- click inside the project window -> create resource\n- search for Theme\n- click on Theme to create\n- Godot now will try to save the Theme\n- Godot is going to crash on attempting to do so\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[l-earn-godot-4-6-FRESH.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24904687/l-earn-godot-4-6-FRESH.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115500/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115500/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}